    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Unleash Chaotic Magic</p></blockquote><p>Your innate magic stems from the forces of chaos that underlie the order of creation. You or an ancestor might have been exposed to raw magic, perhaps through a planar portal leading to Limbo or the Elemental Planes. Perhaps you were blessed by a fey being or marked by a demon, or your magic is a fluke with no apparent cause. Whatever its source, this magic churns within you, waiting for any outlet.</p><h3>Wild Magic Sorcery Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.7exwAd1NMYxu8w5b]{Wild Magic Surge}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.iRpteNRwefzMzPZs]{Tides of Chaos}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.AhGxgmjcc2PY38Kf]{Bend Luck}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Lz6cCLPRCo2Gk7VX]{Controlled Chaos}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.YQnyH3UqmQ1HpZET]{Tamed Surge}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
